name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q9_2026'

question 'A music app shows a "Turn up the volume?" message only when the current volume is below 30. Which structure best describes this logic?'

wrong 'A loop that plays the song until volume changes.'
wrong 'A variable that stores the volume.'
right 'An if/else statement that checks whether the volume is below 30 and shows the message only when that is true.'
wrong 'A function with no body.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

